  m_Name: Carta_SaneamentoIntegrado
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Saneamento Integrado
  _titleEn: Integrated Sanitation
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "\xC1gua tratada, esgoto coletado e drenagem juntos evitam doen\xE7as
    e polui\xE7\xE3o dos rios."
  _summaryEn: Treated water, sewage collection and drainage together prevent disease
    and river pollution.
  _realWorld: "O Marco Legal do Saneamento, de 2020, fixou a meta de levar \xE1gua
    a 99% e coleta de esgoto a 90% da popula\xE7\xE3o at\xE9 2033."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's 2020 sanitation framework set the goal of providing water
    to 99% and sewage collection to 90% of the population by 2033.
  _tradeOffs: "Obras de esgoto s\xE3o caras e invis\xEDveis, e a forma de financi\xE1-las,
    por tarifas ou privatiza\xE7\xE3o, \xE9 debatida."
  _tradeOffsEn: Sewage works are expensive and invisible, and how to fund them, through
    fees or privatization, is debated.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 14.026/2020 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2019-2022/2020/lei/l14026.htm
